      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Important Reminder: Promoting Ergonomic Work Setups for Health and Productivity\n\nDear Remote Team Members,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. As your HR Operations Manager, I would like to remind you of the importance of proper ergonomics in your everyday work setup. To prevent wrist discomfort and back pain, ensure your workspace allows for an organized desk, comfortable seating, and an adequately positioned monitor. Take a moment to adjust your chair height, keyboard, and footrest as needed. Your health and productivity matter greatly to us.\n\nThank you for your attention to this matter.\n\nWarm regards,\n\n[Your Name]  \nHR Operations Manager\n\n[^1] Ergonomics refers to designing workspaces or systems to fit the health and needs of users, with an aim to enhance productivity, reduce discomfort, and prevent long-term injury.",
